('birdpark','Behavior','Recordings of zebra finch group behaviors with manually annotated vocal segments','10.5281/zenodo.13144875','https://zenodo.org/records/13144875','Audio, video, accelerometer and HDF5 annotations','Vocal attribution and synchronized social behavior','GPL-2.0-or-later in record; inspect embedded rights','Annotations and README acquired; 12.3 GB recordings deferred','Annotations alone are not the full audiovisual recording set'),
