('hvc-isolation','Models','Self-organization of songbird neural sequences during social isolation','10.7554/eLife.77262','https://elifesciences.org/articles/77262','Calcium imaging and song; Dryad j0zpc86km','Reproduce sequence extraction before extending a plasticity model','Verify Dryad file terms','Article and data statement reviewed','Sequence correlation is not anatomical connectivity; preserve tutor exposure and age'),
('hvc-intrinsic','Models','Intrinsic properties link a network model to zebra finch song','10.7554/eLife.99611','https://elifesciences.org/articles/99611','Patch-clamp data, MATLAB model, Python notebook; Dryad wdbrv162x','Reproduce published neuron features and network behavior','Verify Dryad record and code terms','Data statement reviewed; 9.81 GB deposit not downloaded','Do not load untrusted pickle files directly; distinguish measured traces from simulated output'),
