('chunking','Behavior','Physiological constraints and cognitive chunking in Zebra Finch songs','10.5061/dryad.rbnzs7hh4','https://datadryad.org/dataset/doi%3A10.5061/dryad.rbnzs7hh4','CSV and R analysis','Reproduce original analysis and compare a Python implementation','Verify repository terms','Dataset file list reviewed','Use current version; keep songs and birds as separate units'),
('wild-song','Behavior','The social role of song in wild zebra finches','10.5061/dryad.stqjq2c6s','https://datadryad.org/dataset/doi%3A10.5061/dryad.stqjq2c6s','Wild ecology and playback data','Compare field context with laboratory song datasets','Verify repository terms','Primary paper and dataset leads reviewed','Observational and experimental components need separate interpretation'),
